# REST API

Extiende `REST_Controller`. CodeIgniter REST: `{metodo}_{http}` → `GET /api/v1/pages` = `index_get`, `POST /api/v1/pages/duplicate/3` = `duplicate_post($id)`.

```php
public function __construct()
{
    parent::__construct();
    $this->output->enable_profiler(false);
    $this->lang->load('rest_lang', 'english');
    if (!$this->verify_request()) {
        $this->response(['code' => REST_Controller::HTTP_UNAUTHORIZED], REST_Controller::HTTP_UNAUTHORIZED);
        exit();
    }
    $this->load->model('Admin/PageModel');
}

public function index_get($page_id = null) { /* find o where; response_ok */ }
```

- Éxito: `$this->response_ok($model)` → `{ code: 200, data: ... }`.
- Error: `$this->response_error(lang('not_found_error'))`. Validación: HTTP 400 + `errors` de `FormValidator`.
- Auth: JWT flaco `sub`+`exp` en `Authorization` (Bearer opcional) **o** sesión cookie. Login es la excepción (`api/v1/LoginController`).
- Tras mutar: `system_logger('pages', $page->page_id, 'created', 'A page has been created');`
- Autor: `$page->user_id = userdata('user_id');`
- Rutas nuevas: `application/config/routes.php` (`$route['api/v1/foo'] = 'api/v1/FooController';`).
- Vue espera `response.data` y `response.code == 200`.
